  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "After waking, she laughs that Spectral Soul Demon Venerable was truly caught. Fairy Zi Wei knows her origin and bows, paying respect to Senior Thunder Ghost True Monarch. The black-armored girl is surprised that someone still knows Jing Lan’s honorific title.",
      "chapters": [
        1553
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_spectral_soul_demon_venerable",
        "char_fairy_zi_wei"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "She has a young girl’s appearance. She wears pitch-black armor that is ferocious and flamboyant, with sharp curved spikes and lightning flashing above it. The chest of the armor has a dark-blue opened mouth like a giant ghost. The helmet looks like a monster’s head, set against her delicate and cute face.",
      "chapters": [
        1553
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Her body is petite; in the armor she stands over ten feet tall and looks tall and bulky. Her pupils are black, then turn azure with lightning circulating in them like a whirlpool.",
      "chapters": [
        1555
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fairy Zi Wei’s spirits rise. Jing Lan was selected from Black Heaven Temple. She mainly cultivates lightning path and soul path, and the two paths do not conflict, a method of her own creation that works only with those two paths. She was born in Spectral Soul Demon Venerable’s time, was extremely proficient in fighting, and had been one of Heavenly Court’s most valuable experts in resisting him. After he became a venerable she hibernated in the immortal graveyard. Fairy Zi Wei asks for guidance. Jing Lan says that if she had all her Immortal Gu she could break the tortoise shell in thirty-three days. Most hibernating Gu Immortals hand over their Immortal Gu. When Fairy Zi Wei reports that some were destroyed, Jing Lan does not mind, then frowns that three core Immortal Gu are gone, so dealing with Spectral Soul would take at least three months. She then offers to flay Spectral Soul’s inheritor instead.",
      "chapters": [
        1553
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_black_heaven_temple",
        "fac_heavenly_court",
        "sys_immortal_gu",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Jing Lan dies in the attack on Lang Ya blessed land, unexpected to Fairy Zi Wei, Chen Yi, and Feng Jiu Ge because they did not expect steal life Immortal Gu. Fang Yuan says Thunder Ghost True Monarch indeed died, but her black armor is soul path in essence and remains like a special soul, while her heart is a final trump card. Her aged body melts from the lightning heart. The unmanned armor flies at quasi-rank nine speed. Narration says her strength overall was at high standard within rank eight, with movement at the peak of that rank, and that the explosion condensed all of her lightning path dao marks into her heart. Fairy Zi Wei cries out for Senior Jing Lan.",
      "chapters": [
        1582
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "death",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_lang_ya_blessed_land",
        "char_chen_yi",
        "char_feng_jiu_ge",
        "gu_steal_life_gu",
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    }
  ],
